      <data key="d5">"cultural reflection, culinary heritage"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;MUSIC&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's writings include themes of music, reflecting his cultural background."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural reflection, musical heritage"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;FESTIVALS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's writings include themes of festivals, reflecting his cultural background."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural reflection, festive traditions"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's writings focus on family, which is a strong and enduring part of his life and cultural identity."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural identity, family legacy"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;TRADITION&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's writings focus on tradition, which is a significant aspect of his cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural heritage, generational continuity"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's writings focus on community, which is an important aspect of his cultural identity and personal connections."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cultural identity, social connections"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ACHARYA&quot;" target="&quot;ANCESTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Acharya's ancestors have lived in India for generations, contributing to its growth and development, which is reflected in Acharya's writings."</data>
      <data key="d5">"ancestral legacy, cultural contribution"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0473</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ANCESTORS&quot;" target="&quot;GROWTH AND DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
